      "reason": "Direction is supported by `G4`: `P8:12` holds apple 1 and selects `heat apple 1 with microwave 1`, then completes at `P8:14`, whereas `P9:14`, `P9:16`, `P10:45` and `P10:47` move the object into the microwave and toggle the door without ever applying heat and hit the step limit. Cooling while holding also works (`P3:8`, `P6:40`, `P7:18`), and `P6:40` succeeds with the fridge closed, so the requirement does not depend on door state. No supplied run shows the prohibition blocking a productive step; the suppressed door-toggling produced no progress in `P9` and `P10`. Keep the whole Update.",
